"<div class=\"wrap\"><section aria-labelledby=\"calc-h\" id=\"team-calculator\" class=\"calculator-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-heading\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Team Persona Posture</p><h2 id=\"calc-h\">Build your team profile</h2><p class=\"lede\">Add your team’s survey results. Submit your team to explore your shared strengths and the postures worth practicing.</p></div>\n    <form class=\"calc\" id=\"team-posture-form\">\n<div class=\"entry-panel\">\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"team\">Team name (optional)</label><input id=\"team\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Product Team\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"entry-heading\"><h3 id=\"member-entry-heading\">Add a team member</h3><p class=\"hint\">Choose their personas, then add them to your team.</p></div>\n<div class=\"field\"><label for=\"draft-name\">Name (optional)</label><input id=\"draft-name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Alex\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<fieldset class=\"persona-choice-field\"><legend>Primary Persona</legend><div class=\"persona-choices\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Primary Persona\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"primary\" data-persona-value=\"0\">Dreamer</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"primary\" data-persona-value=\"1\">Planner</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"primary\" data-persona-value=\"2\">Doer</button></div></fieldset><fieldset class=\"persona-choice-field\"><legend>Secondary Persona (optional)</legend><div class=\"persona-choices\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Secondary Persona (optional)\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"secondary\" data-persona-value=\"0\">Dreamer</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"secondary\" data-persona-value=\"1\">Planner</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"persona-choice\" data-persona-kind=\"secondary\" data-persona-value=\"2\">Doer</button></div></fieldset><p id=\"member-entry-error\" class=\"entry-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>\n<div class=\"entry-actions\"><button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"addMember\" type=\"button\">Add team member</button><button class=\"btn\" id=\"cancel-member-edit\" type=\"button\" hidden>Cancel edit</button></div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"team-roster-panel\"><div class=\"roster-head\"><h3>Your team <span id=\"roster-count\">0</span></h3><span class=\"hint\">Names are optional · Kept in this browser tab</span></div><div class=\"roster\" id=\"roster\"></div><div class=\"roster-footer\"><p class=\"sec-status\" id=\"secStatus\"></p><button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"submit\">View team results →</button></div><p id=\"team-form-error\" class=\"sec-status warn\" role=\"alert\"></p></div>\n<div class=\"bar\" id=\"bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <div class=\"legend\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--orange)\"></i>Dreamer Persona</span>\n        <span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--grey-mid)\"></i>Planner Persona</span>\n        <span><i class=\"dot\" style=\"background:var(--fg)\"></i>Doer Persona</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"size\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Team Size</span><b id=\"size\">0</b></div>\n      </form><div class=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <span class=\"pill\">Team Persona Posture</span>\n      <h3 id=\"summary\">Add your team's personas</h3>\n      <p id=\"desc\">Add each team member's Primary and Secondary Persona.</p>\n      <div class=\"qa\" id=\"qa\" hidden></div>\n      \n      <p class=\"gap-note\" id=\"gapnote\" hidden></p>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"countnote\">Counts reflect surveyed primary preferences, not fixed abilities or current meeting posture.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"copy\" type=\"button\">Copy Team Posture</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"reset\" type=\"button\">Reset</button>\n        <span class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section><section class=\"posture-details\" aria-labelledby=\"posture-details-title\"><h2 id=\"posture-details-title\">Your Team’s Persona Profile</h2><div class=\"persona-posture-columns\"><div class=\"deep\" id=\"primDeep\" hidden></div>\n      <div class=\"deep\" id=\"secDeep\" hidden></div></div>\n      <div class=\"coverage\" id=\"coverage\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Posture Score Breakdown</div>\n        <p id=\"secSummary\" hidden></p>\n        <div class=\"tbl\"><table>\n          <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Persona</th><th scope=\"col\">Primary ×2</th><th scope=\"col\">Secondary ×1</th><th scope=\"col\">Posture score</th><th scope=\"col\">Top two</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody id=\"covBody\"></tbody>\n        </table></div>\n      </div>\n      </section><section aria-labelledby=\"fr-h\">\n    <h2 id=\"fr-h\">Potential Friction Points</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Based on this team's persona mix. Friction is not conflict. It is a signal that the team may need to switch personas on purpose.</p>\n    <div class=\"friction\" id=\"friction\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n  </section><section aria-labelledby=\"why-h\" class=\"why\">\n    <h2 id=\"why-h\">Why this tool exists</h2>\n    <div class=\"why-grid\">\n      <article class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"why-step\">The problem</span>\n        <h3>Teams stall when they think in different ways at the same moment</h3>\n        <p>Teams rarely fail for lack of talent or information. They stall when one member is in the Dreamer Persona exploring new ideas, another is in the Planner Persona locking in details, and a third is in the Doer Persona pushing to act. Without a shared language for this, it shows up as conflict, resistance, or \"poor communication,\" and innovation, collaboration, and execution all suffer.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"why-card\">\n        <span class=\"why-step\">The usual approach</span>\n        <h3>Assessments and workshops that describe people</h3>\n        <p>Most organizations reach for personality assessments such as DISC, Enneagram, CliftonStrengths, or 16 Personalities, plus team-building workshops. They build self-awareness, but they:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Label each person with a fixed type</li>\n          <li>Keep the insight in individual reports</li>\n          <li>Rarely change how the team works together the next day</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"why-card dpd\">\n        <span class=\"why-step\">How DPD is different</span>\n        <h3>A shared language that aligns thinking and behavior</h3>\n        <ul>\n          <li><b>Personas are postures, not labels.</b> Everyone can switch into the Dreamer Persona, Planner Persona, and Doer Persona.</li>\n          <li><b>The team is the unit.</b> This tool shows your team's collective persona posture, not just individual results.</li>\n          <li><b>Insight becomes action.</b> It names what the team needs to practice and which meeting mode to use.</li>\n          <li><b>It works with what you have.</b> DPD complements the assessments your team already uses.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"why-use\"><b>How to use it:</b> enter each member's Primary and Secondary Persona from DPDing, read your Team Persona Posture, then choose the meeting mode the work needs.</p>\n  </section><section aria-labelledby=\"mo-h\">\n    <h2 id=\"mo-h\">The Five Meeting Modes</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Name the mode before every meeting. Each mode asks the whole team to take the same persona posture, whatever their primary preference.</p>\n    <div class=\"meeting-timeline\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Meeting modes\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"meeting-mode-tab-0\" aria-controls=\"meeting-mode-panel-0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"timeline-number\">1</span><span class=\"timeline-label\">Mind Dump</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"meeting-mode-tab-1\" aria-controls=\"meeting-mode-panel-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"timeline-number\">2</span><span class=\"timeline-label\">Dream</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"meeting-mode-tab-2\" aria-controls=\"meeting-mode-panel-2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"timeline-number\">3</span><span class=\"timeline-label\">Plan</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"meeting-mode-tab-3\" aria-controls=\"meeting-mode-panel-3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"timeline-number\">4</span><span class=\"timeline-label\">Do</span></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"meeting-mode-tab-4\" aria-controls=\"meeting-mode-panel-4\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"timeline-number\">5</span><span class=\"timeline-label\">Assess</span></button></div><div class=\"modes\">\n      <article class=\"mode\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"meeting-mode-panel-0\" aria-labelledby=\"meeting-mode-tab-0\">\n        <header><span class=\"num\">1</span><div><h3>Mind Dump</h3><span class=\"posture\">All Personas</span></div></header>\n        <p><b>Definition:</b> An open, unfiltered capture of everything on the team's mind about the work: ideas, tasks, worries, and questions.</p>\n        <p><b>Purpose:</b> Clear mental clutter so the team sees the whole picture before choosing a mode.</p>\n        <div class=\"meeting-guidelines\"><div class=\"meeting-rules\"><h4>Rules</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Everyone contributes, from every persona.</li>\n          <li>Capture everything where the whole team can see it.</li>\n          <li>No evaluating, debating, or solving yet.</li>\n          <li>Time-box it, for example 10 minutes.</li>\n          <li>End by sorting each item into Dream, Plan, or Do.</li>\n        </ul></div><div class=\"meeting-off-limits\"><h4 class=\"off\">Off limits</h4>\n        <ul class=\"offl\">\n          <li>Judging, debating, or ranking what is shared</li>\n          <li>Solving problems or assigning tasks</li>\n          <li>Filtering out items that seem small or off-topic</li>\n          <li>Deciding priorities</li>\n        </ul></div></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"mode\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"meeting-mode-panel-1\" aria-labelledby=\"meeting-mode-tab-1\" hidden>\n        <header><span class=\"num\">2</span><div><h3>Dream Meeting Mode</h3><span class=\"posture\">Dreamer Persona Posture</span></div></header>\n        <p><b>Definition:</b> A meeting where everyone switches into the Dreamer Persona to explore what could be.</p>\n        <p><b>Purpose:</b> Generate options and direction before narrowing down.</p>\n        <div class=\"meeting-guidelines\"><div class=\"meeting-rules\"><h4>Rules</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Everyone switches into the Dreamer Persona.</li>\n          <li>Build on ideas with \"yes, and.\"</li>\n          <li>No judging feasibility, budget, or timelines yet.</li>\n          <li>Bold ideas are welcome. Capture every one.</li>\n          <li>End by choosing a short list to carry into Plan Meeting Mode.</li>\n        </ul></div><div class=\"meeting-off-limits\"><h4 class=\"off\">Off limits</h4>\n        <ul class=\"offl\">\n          <li>Feasibility checks, budgets, and timelines</li>\n          <li>Shutting ideas down with \"we tried that before\"</li>\n          <li>Assigning owners or tasks</li>\n          <li>Picking a final answer too early</li>\n        </ul></div></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"mode\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"meeting-mode-panel-2\" aria-labelledby=\"meeting-mode-tab-2\" hidden>\n        <header><span class=\"num\">3</span><div><h3>Plan Meeting Mode</h3><span class=\"posture\">Planner Persona Posture</span></div></header>\n        <p><b>Definition:</b> A meeting where everyone switches into the Planner Persona to turn chosen ideas into structure.</p>\n        <p><b>Purpose:</b> Agree on what will happen, who owns it, and when.</p>\n        <div class=\"meeting-guidelines\"><div class=\"meeting-rules\"><h4>Rules</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Everyone switches into the Planner Persona.</li>\n          <li>Work only from ideas chosen in Dream Meeting Mode. Park new ideas for the next Dream round.</li>\n          <li>Give every task one owner and a date.</li>\n          <li>Name risks and dependencies.</li>\n          <li>End with a plan everyone can state back.</li>\n        </ul></div><div class=\"meeting-off-limits\"><h4 class=\"off\">Off limits</h4>\n        <ul class=\"offl\">\n          <li>Brand-new ideas. Park them for the next Dream round.</li>\n          <li>Reopening ideas the team already chose</li>\n          <li>Starting the work during the meeting</li>\n          <li>Tasks without an owner or a date</li>\n        </ul></div></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"mode\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"meeting-mode-panel-3\" aria-labelledby=\"meeting-mode-tab-3\" hidden>\n        <header><span class=\"num\">4</span><div><h3>Do Meeting Mode</h3><span class=\"posture\">Doer Persona Posture</span></div></header>\n        <p><b>Definition:</b> A meeting where everyone switches into the Doer Persona to move the plan forward.</p>\n        <p><b>Purpose:</b> Turn the plan into progress and clear what is blocking it.</p>\n        <div class=\"meeting-guidelines\"><div class=\"meeting-rules\"><h4>Rules</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Everyone switches into the Doer Persona.</li>\n          <li>Share progress and blockers, not new ideas or re-planning.</li>\n          <li>Solve blockers fast or take them offline.</li>\n          <li>Keep it short.</li>\n          <li>End with next actions and owners.</li>\n        </ul></div><div class=\"meeting-off-limits\"><h4 class=\"off\">Off limits</h4>\n        <ul class=\"offl\">\n          <li>Brainstorming or new ideas</li>\n          <li>Re-planning scope or timelines. Flag it for Plan or Assess Meeting Mode.</li>\n          <li>Long problem-solving discussions</li>\n          <li>Updates with no next action</li>\n        </ul></div></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"mode\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"meeting-mode-panel-4\" aria-labelledby=\"meeting-mode-tab-4\" hidden>\n        <header><span class=\"num\">5</span><div><h3>Assess Meeting Mode</h3><span class=\"posture\">Review</span></div></header>\n        <p><b>Definition:</b> A meeting to step back and review results and how the team used each persona posture.</p>\n        <p><b>Purpose:</b> Learn what worked and decide which mode the team needs next.</p>\n        <div class=\"meeting-guidelines\"><div class=\"meeting-rules\"><h4>Rules</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Compare results against the plan.</li>\n          <li>Ask which persona postures helped and which were missing.</li>\n          <li>Focus on the process, not on blame.</li>\n          <li>Capture lessons where the team can find them again.</li>\n          <li>End by choosing the next mode. Often that is Mind Dump or Dream.</li>\n        </ul></div><div class=\"meeting-off-limits\"><h4 class=\"off\">Off limits</h4>\n        <ul class=\"offl\">\n          <li>Blame or personal critique</li>\n          <li>Redoing the work in the meeting</li>\n          <li>Planning the next round before lessons are captured</li>\n          <li>Skipping what went well</li>\n        </ul></div></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section><section aria-labelledby=\"ex-h\">\n    <h2 id=\"ex-h\">Try an Example</h2>\n    <div class=\"examples\">\n      <button class=\"ex\" type=\"button\" data-m=\"0-2,0-2,1-0\"><b>Team of 3</b><span>Primary: Dreamer Persona 2 · Planner Persona 1 · Doer Persona 0</span><span>Secondary: Dreamer Persona 1 · Planner Persona 0 · Doer Persona 2</span></button>\n      <button class=\"ex\" type=\"button\" data-m=\"0-2,1-0,1-0,1-2,2-1\"><b>Team of 5</b><span>Primary: Dreamer Persona 1 · Planner Persona 3 · Doer Persona 1</span><span>Secondary: Dreamer Persona 2 · Planner Persona 1 · Doer Persona 2</span></button>\n      <button class=\"ex\" type=\"button\" data-m=\"0-1,0-2,1-0,1-0,2-0,2-1,2-1\"><b>Team of 7</b><span>Primary: Dreamer Persona 2 · Planner Persona 2 · Doer Persona 3</span><span>Secondary: Dreamer Persona 3 · Planner Persona 3 · Doer Persona 1</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section><section aria-labelledby=\"sc-h\">\n    <h2 id=\"sc-h\">Manager Facilitation Script</h2>\n    <div class=\"facilitation-chat\"><div class=\"script-chat-heading\"><span class=\"script-chat-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M17 8h2a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2v4l-4-4H9a1.994 1.994 0 01-1.414-.586m0 0L11 14h4a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2v4l.586-.586z\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"script-chat-title\">Start the conversation</p><p class=\"script-chat-subtitle\">Suggested talking points for your next team meeting</p></div></div><ol class=\"script\"><li class=\"script-message\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>Now that we have our individual results, let's look at our team as a whole.</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>We have <mark id=\"sD\">0</mark> Dreamer Personas, <mark id=\"sP\">0</mark> Planner Personas, and <mark id=\"sO\">0</mark> Doer Personas represented as primary preferences.</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message\" id=\"secLine\" hidden><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>As secondary preferences, we have <mark id=\"s2D\">0</mark> Dreamer Personas, <mark id=\"s2P\">0</mark> Planner Personas, and <mark id=\"s2O\">0</mark> Doer Personas. These are personas many of us can switch into when the work calls for them.</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>This gives us a snapshot of how we naturally prefer to approach work.</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>It doesn't mean anyone is limited to one persona. We can all Dream, Plan, and Do.</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>The question is: Are we using the right persona for the work we're doing at the moment?</p></div></li><li class=\"script-message script-message-question\"><span class=\"script-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">M</span><div class=\"script-bubble\"><span class=\"script-speaker\">Manager</span><p>What's one thing we could do differently in our next meeting?</p></div></li></ol></div>\n    <p class=\"tip\">For the first manager experience, use primary personas only. Introduce secondary personas as a second level of analysis once the team is comfortable with the language.</p>\n  </section><section class=\"cta\" aria-labelledby=\"cta-h\"><div class=\"cta-copy\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Take the next step</div>\n    <h2 id=\"cta-h\">Schedule a Team Building Webinar</h2>\n    <p>Turn your Team Persona Posture into practice. A DPD facilitator walks your team through switching between the Dreamer Persona, Planner Persona, and Doer Persona, and running each meeting mode with intention.</p>\n    <a class=\"btn primary cta-btn\" href=\"/webinars\">Schedule a Team Building Webinar</a>\n    \n    \n  </div><div class=\"cta-slideshow\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Webinar photos\"><img class=\"cta-slide is-active\" src=\"/webinars/leadership-webinar.jpg\" alt=\"A team taking part in a video session together\" aria-hidden=\"false\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"5910\" height=\"3940\"><img class=\"cta-slide\" src=\"/webinars/core-webinar.jpg\" alt=\"A participant joining a webinar from her laptop\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"5910\" height=\"3940\"><img class=\"cta-slide\" src=\"/webinars/persona-switching-webinar.jpg\" alt=\"Participants connecting during an online session\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"5910\" height=\"3940\"></div></section></div>"